message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it using the preferred-citation
  information.
type: dataset
title: Códigos postales de España
abstract: >-
  Estimated postal code boundaries for Spain derived from open CartoCiudad
  address data and administrative boundaries. The dataset is generated using
  Voronoi tessellation and administrative clipping and does not represent
  official postal boundaries.
